  "intro": {
    "title": "Mein Lieblingsfach ist Mathe",
    "paragraphs": [
      "School subjects take no article when you name them: Ich habe Mathe. Wir haben heute Sport. Many have short forms that pupils use: Mathe, Bio, Reli.",
      "German grades run backwards from what many expect: eine Eins is the best mark, eine Sechs the worst. The Abitur at the end of school opens the way to university."
    ]
